'''Birth of True Man''' is the eighth and final stage in [[Humanity Catified]]. [[Pterowl Hazuku]] makes his first and only appearance in Uncanny Legends here. This [[No Continues]] stage drops 3 [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum Shards]] when cleared for the first time.

